                                "sense_id": "06b1120e-62c6-3312-b194-f89993d2eed9",
                                "text": "The line to Dunières consists of a series of breakneck descents almost invariably ended by a violent curve and followed immediately by a panting climb, on which the engine barked thunderously but failed unhappily to maintain its booked speed of 13 m.p.h."
